configTransformStatusAction.title:
TransformStatusAction maps a raw provider status string (from hrms_attributes) to an
Andromeda ExternalUserStatus enum using a configurable key-value list.
Use MAP operation with kv_list for per-tenant status value mappings.
Example:
  {
    "attr_value_op": "MAP",
    "kv_list": [
      { "key": "1",          "value": "ENABLED" },
      { "key": "active",     "value": "ENABLED" },
      { "key": "terminated", "value": "DEPROVISIONED" }
    ],
    "default_value": "DISABLED"
  }

